note = "To generate Darkmode axis we are using the Batch Grader script from mekkablue
with the followings settings :

Add grade : [1]
Axis tag & name : [DRKM], [Darkmode]
In name, search for [keep it empty] and replace with [ Darkmode]
[ ] Add graded brace layers (slow)
[X] Use default interpolation
[X] Add custom parameter « Link Metrics With Master’ 
[X] Keep centered glyphs centered; max SB diff threshold [2]
[ ] Only apply to the current Glyph


Recipe for new graded masters :

# mastername: wght+=100, wdth=100
Regular: wght-=4
Regular Italic: wght-=4
Bold: wght-=10
Bold Italic: wght-=10
Mono Regular: wght-=4
Mono Regular Italic: wght-=4
Mono Bold: wght-=10
Mono Bold Italic: wght-=10
";
